        "symbol": "◆"
      },
      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "The bregdi pulls a creature it can reach or a creature holding something it can reach (such as a fishing line in the water). The bregdi attempts an Athletics check against the creature's Fortitude DC. On a success, it pulls the creature into an adjacent space. On a critical success, the bregdi can also make a jaws Strike against the creature pulled into an adjacent space."
      ]
